    "CoiStatement": "One of the authors (PW) is an inventor of the PCT applications WO/2010/120726: \"Treatment of inflammatory diseases by the inhibition of cold shock proteins\" and US 61/881,798: \"Peptides inhibiting cold-inducible RNA binding protein activity.\" These patent applications cover the fundamental concept of inhibiting CIRP for the treatment of inflammatory diseases. The other authors have no conflict of interest.",
